    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9334" root="حنف" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَنِيفِيَّةٌ</span></b> , accord. to Th and Zj, <i>An inclining</i> to
a thing: but ISd says that this explanation is
nought. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  The <i>law of Abraham;</i> which
is the <i>religion of El-Islám:</i> also termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِلَّةٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَنِيفِيَّةٌ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَنَفِيَّةٌ</span>.

